34\",\"Lee Edmond\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVqfAqCauvYyU8yXQNSlwnmkMCEJnFv4SsNe0S5Bja4JAxn8xM\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.74.18\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"bdf49a5a-f6f8-4fb4-bd0d-2554bd54c52c\",[\"tang alextong\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVfIBfXXhcNNfoYrUmFA2KQzhOQIMLfGNKpw2SMD2fyzMKYw\\u003dmo\"]]],5,null,\"安全\",[1791710280,618000000],0,null,null,[\"105441705700522044136\",\"tang alextong\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLVfIBfXXhcNNfoYrUmFA2KQzhOQIMLfGNKpw2SMD2fyzMKYw\\u003dmo\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.74.18\",null,null,null,null,null,1],[\"830f3e43-af8c-4a0a-bcc7-a505b8da244a\",[\"Chan David\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0zNjGzhXYQB1bGN5GE1IDCsQi0BcSi981ZPWrCGbFZWUKPeI\"]]],1,null,\"史上最垃圾服務態度 打電話一個鐘頭二十分鐘 去到大概40幾分鐘。終於有人聽電話之後佢好似完全唔知道個程序點樣整之後佢就拋個波俾第2個分行專人接聽。 然之後等嘅都聽唔到電話。 其實不如留翻俾ai去做啦。反正都咁垃圾\",[1791378231,290000000],0,null,null,[\"115188349023903887493\",\"Chan David\",null,[[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW0zNjGzhXYQB1bGN5GE1IDCsQi0BcSi981ZPWrCGbFZWUKPeI\"]],true],[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Yq7oyNIvAAkuc69fG51sbAQS4otJxbObbt3xdr8tXxXyUdq4tVGtfgeKuptveGdP1srxaHVrNPzOYcfaEQ\"]]],\"3.74.18\",null,null,null,[true,false],null,1],[\"b0958d05-9fbd-4837-8bb1-256532ad8cd2\",[\"Ka John Li\",[null,2,null,[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIZc6D0ZDeQeeiaNEKKRPsCtiSWh2m7y0JbFOu3xejFh4T44A\\u003dmo\"]]],1,null,\"最近在刪除手機快取後，會無法載入登入版面，等一小時都全沒反應，刪除App亦要重新進行身份認證。當顧客想利用App做手機提款、查閱戶口、轉數快等功能，會因HSBC HK App的穩定性